---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
interface Props { full?: boolean; }
const { full = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['course-grid', { 'course-grid-full': full }]}>
  {full && <a href="https://10xdevs.pl" class="course-card course-ai"><div class="course-art ai-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-coordinate">03 / AI-NATIVE</span><span class="ai-art-mark">10x</span><div class="ai-art-orbit"></div><span class="art-caption">human × AI</span></div><div class="course-body"><div class="course-meta"><span class="pill">AI & ENGINEERING</span><span>Program szkoleniowy</span></div><h3>10xDevs</h3><p>Pracuj z agentami AI w całym cyklu rozwoju oprogramowania. Od pomysłu i architektury po testy i wdrożenie.</p><div class="course-bottom"><span>Workflow z AI · Projekty · Społeczność</span><span class="circle-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" /></span></div></div></a>}
  <a href="https://opanujfrontend.pl" class="course-card"><div class="course-art frontend-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-coordinate">01 / FRONTEND DEVELOPMENT</span><div class="browser-art"><div class="browser-toolbar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>your-next-project.dev</span></div><div class="browser-art-content"><div class="mock-sidebar"><b></b><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="mock-page"><span class="mock-eyebrow">BUILD SOMETHING GREAT</span><span class="mock-title">Hello, future.</span><div class="mock-lines"></div><div class="mock-button"></div><span class="mock-code">&lt;/&gt;</span></div></div></div><span class="floating-tag">React <span>↗</span></span><span class="art-caption">craft. build. ship.</span></div><div class="course-body"><div class="course-meta"><span class="pill">FRONTEND</span><span>AI Edition</span></div><h3>Opanuj Frontend<span class="small-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" size={25}/></span></h3><p>Buduj nowoczesne aplikacje webowe. Rozwijaj warsztat w obszarach architektury, testowania i CI/CD, korzystając z AI.</p><div class="course-bottom"><span>5 modułów <span class="meta-dot">·</span> Praktyczne projekty</span><span class="course-link">Poznaj kurs <Icon name="right" size={16}/></span></div></div></a>
  <a href="https://opanujtypescript.pl" class="course-card"><div class="course-art typescript-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-coordinate">02 / TYPESCRIPT & REACT</span><div class="ts-art-main"><span class="ts-square">TS</span><span class="ts-brackets">&#123; &#125;</span></div><div class="ts-code"><span>type</span> Developer = &#123;<br />&nbsp; skills: <span>TypeScript[]</span>;<br />&nbsp; potential: <span>∞</span>;<br />&#125;;</div><span class="art-caption">type with confidence.</span></div><div class="course-body"><div class="course-meta"><span class="pill">TYPESCRIPT</span><span>Frontend Pro</span></div><h3>Opanuj TypeScript<span class="small-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" size={25}/></span></h3><p>Od dobrych typów do lepszych aplikacji. Poznaj zaawansowany TypeScript i wykorzystaj go w projektach z React 19.</p><div class="course-bottom"><span>45+ zadań <span class="meta-dot">·</span> Dożywotni dostęp</span><span class="course-link">Poznaj kurs <Icon name="right" size={16}/></span></div></div></a>
</div>
